      "constraints": [
        "Time limit: 2 sec; Memory limit: 1024 MiB; Constraints: 1\\le N\\le2\\times10 ^ 5; 1\\le A\\le10 ^ 9; 1\\le B\\le10 ^ 9; -10 ^ 9\\le P _ i\\le10 ^ 9\\ (1\\le i\\le N); 1\\le Q\\le2\\times10 ^ 5; T _ i=1 or T _ i=2\\ (1\\le i\\le Q); There exists an integer i\\ (1\\le i\\le Q) such that T _ i=2.; If T _ i=1, then -10 ^ 9\\le X _ i\\le10 ^ 9. (1\\le i\\le Q); If T _ i=2, then -10 ^ {12}\\le X _ i\\le10 ^ {12}. (1\\le i\\le Q); All input values are integers."
